name: Oops Pile
author: nat break
description: >
  A shitload of Oops! All 6s. Must hit at least 2 separate Oops appearances
  in antes 1-4 (shop + packs). Should ranks how many more show up through ante 6.
  Luck stacks as 2^n — two Oops = 4x, three = 8x. Red White, no gimmick decks.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4]
    min: 2
should:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]
    score: 10
    label: oops

seeds:
  - 2LOL2
  - B8B
  - AXA
  - FVF
  - 9WW9
  - UFU
  - V88V
  - 14D41
  - 1OYO1
  - 1UIU1
  - 1ZFZ1
  - 1R5R1
  - 2AMA2
  - 2C4C2
  - 2DYD2
  - 2KZK2
